message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "One Bad Passage in 10,000: measuring retrieval poisoning in a RAG pipeline"
abstract: "Plants one false or malicious passage at a time in a 10,000-passage corpus and measures how many questions it reaches, how often three open LLMs repeat it, how far it spreads, and what simple defences cost in clean accuracy."
